  "plain": "In 2026, according to the researcher Grant Cameron, a reporter asked Donald Trump about aliens and Trump answered, \"Oh, it's classified material,\" and the reporter followed up: \"So you're saying aliens are real?\" Cameron repeats the exchange to Michels without naming where it was reported, and also brings up Barack Obama in the same breath. He tells it because, if a president calls the subject classified, he is in effect saying there is something real to classify."
